---
// Layout and Component Imports would go here in a larger app
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>SyncFlow | Workflow Automation</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-light text-slate font-sans antialiased">
    
    <header class="px-8 py-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
      <div class="font-black text-2xl tracking-tighter">SyncFlow</div>
      <nav class="hidden md:flex gap-8 font-medium text-slate/70">
        <a href="#features" class="hover:text-primary transition">Products</a>
        <a href="#integrations" class="hover:text-primary transition">Integrations</a>
        <a href="#pricing" class="hover:text-primary transition">Pricing</a>
      </nav>
      <a href="#" class="bg-primary text-white px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full font-semibold shadow-soft hover:shadow-lg transition">Dashboard &rarr;</a>
    </header>

    <main class="pt-24 pb-16 px-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h1 class="text-6xl font-black tracking-tight mb-8 leading-tight">Financial infrastructure <br/> for the internet.</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-slate/70 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Millions of companies of all sizes use SyncFlow online and in person to accept payments, send payouts, automate financial processes, and ultimately grow revenue.</p>
      <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
        <button class="bg-primary text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full font-semibold shadow-soft hover:shadow-lg transition">Start now</button>
        <button class="text-slate font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 hover:text-primary transition">Contact sales &gt;</button>
      </div>
    </main>

    <section id="integrations" class="py-20 bg-white skew-y-3 transform origin-top-left mt-20 border-t border-gray-100">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 -skew-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center">Connects with your existing stack</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 opacity-60">
          <div class="h-12 bg-gray-200 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-sm">Slack API</div>
          <div class="h-12 bg-gray-200 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-sm">Salesforce</div>
          <div class="h-12 bg-gray-200 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-sm">Zendesk</div>
          <div class="h-12 bg-gray-200 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center font-mono text-sm">HubSpot</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-24 px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <blockquote class="text-2xl font-medium italic mb-8">"SyncFlow completely removed our engineering bottleneck. We deployed complex workflow logic in hours instead of sprints."</blockquote>
      <div class="font-bold text-lg">CTO, FastScale Inc.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 bg-white px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-10">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="border-b border-gray-100 pb-6">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Can I self-host the infrastructure?</h4>
            <p class="text-slate/70">Yes, Enterprise clients can deploy our containerized solution to their own Kubernetes clusters via Helm.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border-b border-gray-100 pb-6">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">What is the API rate limit?</h4>
            <p class="text-slate/70">Standard accounts support up to 1,000 requests per minute.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-slate text-white py-12 text-center">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-8 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-left mb-12 text-sm">
        <div>
          <div class="font-bold mb-4">Products</div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-white/60"><li>Atlas</li><li>Billing</li><li>Connect</li></ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-white/40 text-sm">© 2026 SyncFlow.</div>
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>
